Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 21:39:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: codecs: wcn-bt-slim: fix the module device table type
 so the module autoloads

MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(slimbus, ...) produces no alias: modpost only knows the "slim" table type
(scripts/mod/file2alias.c). Without the slim:217:22x:* aliases the module never loads on its own, the
sound card waits 90 s for the SLIMBUS_7 codec on every boot and PipeWire, started meanwhile, is left
with a stuck playback path.
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
index 887b339f2..1e0dd4ebc 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcn-bt-slim.c
@@ -1456,7 +1456,7 @@ static const struct slim_device_id wcn_bt_slim_id[] = {
 	{ 0x217, 0x221, 0x1, 0x0 },	/* WCN6750 ported generic device */
 	{}
 };
-MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(slimbus, wcn_bt_slim_id);
+MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(slim, wcn_bt_slim_id);
 
 static struct slim_driver wcn_bt_slim_driver = {
 	.driver = {
-- 
2.47.3

